OL,3,GNEWSAGirl killed in crash near Highgate
OL,4,ASchool
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old girl has been killed in a
OL,7,Fcrash near Highgate School in north
OL,8,FLondon.
OL,10,FThe Met Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to North Road, Highgate, at
OL,12,Fabout 08:15 BST following reports of a
OL,13,Fcollision involving a pedestrian and
OL,14,Fcar.
OL,16,FThe girl was pronounced dead at the
OL,17,Fscene, near the private school's main
OL,18,Fsite. The driver of the car, a
OL,19,F68-year-old man, remained at the scene
OL,20,Fand was arrested on suspicion of
OL,21,Fcausing death by careless driving.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
